      <groundspeak:encoded_hints>BOULDER/ROCK OUTCROP 26CM S MP
 
BRASS CAP IN BOULDER/ROCK OUTCROP 5.73 M NE OF AN UTILITY BOX; 0.26 M S OF A WITNESS SIGN . 23.6 M N OF C/L OF HWY #16</groundspeak:encoded_hints>
