          <groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type>
          <groundspeak:finder id="3999751">GJO_2010</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BCP 526  DECOIGNE&lt;/strong&gt;

On a mission to grab a few virtuals and a webcam this weekend before heading home to Ontario. Today I drove from Swan Hills to Prince George with just a couple stops with this being one of them. Found the cap in great shape. Thanks very much for the break and the virtual!!!&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
        <groundspeak:log id="431280889">
