          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP526 - Decoigne

Posted: N52 52.976 W118 22.646

MyGPSr: N52 52.975 W118 22.647&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Spotted the nearby solar panel box from the highway. The skeeters were out in full force this evening. Found this one as the sun was setting. Thanks for the cap.&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
        <groundspeak:log id="424101868">
          <groundspeak:date>2014-07-06T20:00:00</groundspeak:date>
          <groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type>
          <groundspeak:finder id="836983">Coolcat21</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP526 Decoigne&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I parked safe on the side of the road and made my way to this easily found cap. The traffic whizzed by as I took the necessary shots and off I went westward.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thanks for the cap!&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
