          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP526 - Decoigne&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our last stop of the night and then off to Jasper for dinner.  I highly recommend Jasper Pizza.  It really hit the spot.  TFTH&lt;/p&gt;

